samir: thanks everyone, great feedback. merging plan: if CI green and no objections by Friday 10:00 PT, merge and release.

eli: ack. I'll watch for CI.

jonah: thanks — also left a tiny example showing how to wrap older array envelopes with a shim function.

maria: added a short changelog entry and a line in the migration checklist about watchlist customers we should notify.

